# Engineering quality (ENFORCED)

## Required gate

```bash
npm run check   # lint + enforce + build
```

Do not claim completion if this fails.

## Git

- Descriptive commits; no secrets, `.env*`, `.next/`, or `node_modules/`.
- Keep `AGENTS.md` Next.js `BEGIN/END:nextjs-agent-rules` markers intact.

## Self-check

- `"use client"` only on leaf components?
- Internal routes use `next/link`?
- Colors/spacing use design tokens?
- Bundled Next.js docs win over training data when they conflict.

## Dependencies

- Prefer existing stack; justify new deps in the PR.
- Banned without explicit approval: styled-components, @emotion/*, @mui/*, pages router packages.
